{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hoop Fighters</strong> is a multiplayer and <strong>rule-free party basketball game</strong> with cartoon graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can beat up your friends or other players while making scores in lobbies which you can create up to 6 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/FirstGif.gif?t=1741478420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can punch, slide or even throw objects around your opponent to get the ball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't forget to run to the ball again after scoring because <strong><i>the game never stops!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/SecondGif.gif?t=1741478420\" /><br>Take your place in the most unregulated and funny basketball game to show off your basketball skills, have unlimited fun and beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/ThirtGif.gif?t=1741478420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the character that reflects your mood best and jump onto the court.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2244520?t=1741478420","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741478420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/1c57ca5c30146a8bd766ac3d8789a36d2aa7bced/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741478420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/1c57ca5c30146a8bd766ac3d8789a36d2aa7bced/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741478420","categories":[{"descri